      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "Apply the algebraic expansion identity $(a - b)^2 = a^2 - 2ab + b^2$ with $a = 1$ and $b = \\frac{1}{2x}$:\n$$\\left(1 - \\frac{1}{2x}\\right)^2 = 1^2 - 2(1)\\left(\\frac{1}{2x}\\right) + \\left(\\frac{1}{2x}\\right)^2$$",
        "Simplify each term:\n$$\\left(1 - \\frac{1}{2x}\\right)^2 = 1 - \\frac{1}{x} + \\frac{1}{4x^2}$$"
      ],
